269 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Aditya Chourasiya; UG III:  Centuries ago, the Silk Road emerged as a bridge between various civilisations. Today, its successor, the Belt and Road Initiative \(BRI\), has become a flashpoint for global frictions. As India and its Western allies prepare to launch the India-Middle EastEurope Economic Corridor \(IMEC\), we are witnessing a paradigm shift: trade routes are becoming the new frontlines of global power influence. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
270 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
